// (the player only, from the inventory window's Craft tab). Tools ("tools" needed, "helpedBy"
// optional) count when they're on the crafter, or within two cells of the station.
// Products that come in materials ("materialsOf") take the main material of what went in: oak
// wood makes oak planks, and oak planks make an oak plank wall. "minSkill" keeps novices off;
// "unlock" (a skill level, or a "discover" trigger) keeps a recipe out of the book until then.
